"""Regenerate the final tables of lane c1-n3 (notes/N3_CERTIFICATION_SUMMARY.md) from the JSON records in certification/results.
Rule: every displayed lower bound is the lower endpoint rounded DOWN, every upper bound the upper endpoint rounded UP (decimal, directional).
Labels: VALIDATED = two-sided whole-plane enclosure computed in this lane; the independent status (CONFIRMED by c1-n4 with the N4 ID, or
CLAIMED pending c1-n4) is taken from the STATUS table below, which is maintained by hand from c1-n4's VERIFY_REPORT and c1-coord's matrix.
Usage: final_tables.py > notes/N3_FINAL_TABLES.md"""
from pathlib import Path
